WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:05.754
Recording a fee payment

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:09.123
Open Finance, then Collect Payments.

00:00:11.347 --> 00:00:14.081
Tick the student's row in the fee table.

00:00:16.511 --> 00:00:22.409
In the bar that appears, enter the amount paid, and choose the account and payment method.

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:32.002
Press Update, then confirm with Yes. Or use Pay Full to take the whole balance. The status updates by itself.

00:00:34.797 --> 00:00:39.482
Payment recorded
